<Project xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/developer/msbuild/2003">
  <!--
    Build-time workaround for the base Windows SDK 10.0.26100.0 XAML compiler bug,
    when compiling with the older 19041 SDK XAML compiler (to dodge the 26100
    WMC9999 crash). That 19041 compiler emits conflicting definitions of some x:Bind
    helper templates (e.g. Get/SetReferenceTypeMember_Header): a correct generic
    variant and a hard-coded-string variant (PropertyValue::CreateString /
    unbox_value<hstring>). They share a signature -> C2995. This target strips the
    bad variant from the freshly generated XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp.

    Ordering (the hard part):
    * MarkupCompilePass1 AND MarkupCompilePass2 BOTH call CompileXaml and regenerate
      XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp; neither has Inputs/Outputs, so both always run. Pass2 is the
      LAST generator. A naive AfterTargets="MarkupCompilePass1;MarkupCompilePass2"
      COALESCES to fire only after Pass1, so Pass2 then re-emits the duplicates. A
      naive BeforeTargets="ClCompile" can fire before MarkupCompilePass2 (which is
      itself a ClCompile-before target), again seeing the stale/duplicate file.
    * The robust fix: hook BeforeTargets="ClCompile" WITH DependsOnTargets=
      "MarkupCompilePass2". MSBuild guarantees MarkupCompilePass2 (the final
      generator) completes immediately before this target, so we dedupe the freshly
      generated file and ClCompile then consumes the clean version. We also keep
      AfterTargets="MarkupCompilePass2" as a belt-and-suspenders hook. The dedupe is
      idempotent, so running it in both places is harmless.
    * Only the Magpie UI project generates XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp -> gate to that project.
    * Injected via /p:CustomAfterMicrosoftCommonTargets (CustomAfterMicrosoftCppTargets
      is NOT honored by the VC toolchain).
    * The script exits 0 on not-found / no-conflicts / success, so the target can never
      abort the build.
  -->
  <Target Name="DedupeXamlTypeInfoWorkaround"
          AfterTargets="MarkupCompilePass2"
          BeforeTargets="ClCompile"
          DependsOnTargets="MarkupCompilePass2"
          Condition="'$(MSBuildProjectName)' == 'Magpie'">
    <Message Text="[workaround] dedupe generated XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp (19041 XAML compiler duplicate-helper bug)" Importance="high" />
    <Exec Command="&quot;C:\Users\wuyua\.workbuddy\binaries\python\versions\3.13.12\python.exe&quot; &quot;C:\Users\wuyua\Project\Magpie\.workbuddy\dedupe_xamltypeinfo.py&quot; &quot;$(IntDir)Generated Files\XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp&quot;"
          ContinueOnError="true" />
  </Target>
</Project>
